                <head>Errata</head>
                <p>The following change has been made to <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign
                        Relations</hi>, 1969–1976, Volume E–12, Documents on East and Southeast
                    Asia, 1973–1976. <!--Revised information is in italic.-->
                </p>
                <list type="simple">
                    <item>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">1. Document 86 (date of correction: October 14,
                            2012)</hi>
                    </item>
                    <item>The date in the document’s heading has been corrected from “March 6, 1976”
                        to “February 27, 1976.”</item>
                </list>
            </div>
